#speaker:Datuk John # slot:left
(I can barely keep up! What started as a desperate attempt to bring back real flavor has transformed this tiny stall into the hottest spot in the sector.)  

#speaker:Datuk John # slot:left
(From Nasi Lemak to Asam Laksa, and finally Ais Kacang... not only did I reconnect with my roots, but the locals can't get enough of it. Finally, I can make my ancestors proud!)  

#speaker:Datuk John # slot:left
(I even had to buy this robot... what was it again? R6-D7? He has been a big help! 
Though the only problem is that he has a weird habit of going into a infinite loop of 67s... and doing this weird hand motion...

#speaker:R6-D7 # slot:right
FERMENTED FISH PREPPED, PEANUTS ADDED, SAMBAL ADDED, ORDER OF NASI LEMAK COMPLETE.

#speaker:Datuk John #slot:left 
Robots are so advanced nowadays... He can easily assemble orders.

#speaker:Jinuchu # slot:right
Greetings, indigenous culinary unit! I am Jinuchu. I have traveled across three star systems following this unprecedented chemical aroma.

#speaker:Datuk John # slot:left 
(How does one speak to an ailen?) Boss, you want makan pa today?

#speaker:Jinuchu # slot:right
Fascinating... Although I have mastered the human tongue, this human's speech is indecipherable...

#speaker:Datuk John #slot:left
(Of course he wouldn't understand Malaysian slang! What was I thinking???) Sorry. Erm. What can I get for you today, Mr Jinuchu?

#speaker:Jinuchu # slot:right
What is that sustenance eminating the strong aroma, Mr Human?

#speaker:Datuk John #slot:left  
Ah, that’s our flagship dish—Nasi Lemak! Fragrant coconut rice served with spicy sambal, crispy sides, and a boiled egg. It’s the ultimate comfort food from Earth's Malaysia!  

#speaker:Jinuchu # slot:right 
Ma-lay-sia? I am unfamiliar with this territory. However, my taste receptors are vibrating in anticipation. Very well, I shall sample this 'Nasi Lemak'.

#speaker:Datuk John # slot:left
One Nasi Lemak coming right up! R6-D7, serve the guest!

#speaker:R6-D7 # slot:right
PROCESSING ORDER... PLATING NASI LEMAK... ENJOY YOUR ORGANIC SUSTENANCE, GUEST JINUCHU.

#speaker:Jinuchu # slot:right
NOM... CHEW...

#speaker:Jinuchu # slot:right
Magnificent! This symphony of spice of and coconut... It is truly magnificent I must say. But why are my pain receptors going off!?

#speaker:Datuk John # slot:left
(Looks like the alien loves it! From selling generic slop to sharing Malaysian heritage with the whole galaxy...)  

#speaker:Datuk John # slot:left 
(Looks like Malaysian cuisine is a hit through cosmoses too.)

#speaker:Jinuchu # slot:right
What is the expenditure for this masterpiece?

#speaker:Datuk John # slot:left 
670 Ailenros sir.

#speaker:Jinuchu # slot:right
Well deserved, Mr Human. *Hands over the money.*

